### Features I would deliberately postpone

These might sound impressive but could distract us from building a dependable education business:

- A social-media-style learner feed.
- Complex gamification and virtual currencies.
- Native Android and iOS applications.
- An AI tutor with unrestricted access to all learner data.
- Advanced proctoring and invasive monitoring.
- A complicated affiliate marketplace.
- Multiple overlapping dashboard systems.
- An elaborate automation engine before the core workflows work.

Build the foundations first. Add these only when there is a demonstrated need.

